WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:09.270
<i>I am Aoba Kurage. I'm almost in high school.</i>

00:09.270 --> 00:11.780
<i>I am a fine adult woman.</i>

00:12.240 --> 00:16.290
<i>But I intend to keep on growing.</i>

00:20.350 --> 00:23.750
Nyagosuke, this is called a diary.

00:23.750 --> 00:25.700
It's proof that I'm an adult.

00:27.340 --> 00:33.660
Kiki-san said self-reflection 
is the first step toward growth.

00:35.320 --> 00:41.680
<i>The biggest thing that's happened recently 
is Akagami-san coming to our home.</i>

00:42.930 --> 00:44.440
I feel so dizzy...

00:48.170 --> 00:49.300
Are you all right?

00:49.780 --> 00:52.350
<i>He was such a gentleman.</i>

00:53.970 --> 00:58.120
<i>Without a doubt, 
I was treated like a grown woman.</i>

00:59.070 --> 01:00.910
I'm an adult.

01:07.830 --> 01:11.590
Done. Now I can reach even greater heights.

01:17.490 --> 01:18.970
Anyway...

01:19.430 --> 01:22.110
<i>Akagami-san is such a strange person.</i>

01:22.740 --> 01:26.570
<i>Our family has begun to change 
little by little ever since he arrived.</i>

01:27.670 --> 01:31.480
<i>But in a very good way.</i>

01:33.090 --> 01:37.370
<i>With Akagami-san around, I'll never 
run out of things to write in my diary.</i>

01:37.370 --> 01:40.490
Kurage-san, dinner is ready.

01:43.050 --> 01:44.310
Coming.

03:18.550 --> 03:25.050
<b>Episode 6:
Let's Establish Facts!</b>

03:19.730 --> 03:21.980
That bath felt amazing.

03:36.890 --> 03:39.320
Let the all-girls meeting begin.

03:40.110 --> 03:41.960
What's going on here?

03:41.960 --> 03:47.080
I always step on the scale 
when I get out of the bath,

03:47.080 --> 03:50.330
but our scale is cursed.

03:51.630 --> 03:58.200
That's right. The curse causes it to 
display a value far higher than expected.

03:58.200 --> 03:59.590
Are you sure you didn't just gain—

03:59.590 --> 04:01.640
Not only that, but mysteriously,

04:01.640 --> 04:05.970
this phenomenon has been occurring 
since Akagami-kun moved in.

04:06.010 --> 04:10.470
<b>Delicious Meals</b>

04:10.020 --> 04:15.190
<b>More, please!</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:13.040
So good!

04:11.630 --> 04:14.030
More, please!

04:13.040 --> 04:14.900
Me, too!

04:16.740 --> 04:20.730
I imagine some of you have 
experienced the same curse.

04:23.660 --> 04:25.800
It's a curse, Yuzu-nee.

04:25.800 --> 04:26.790
Definitely a curse.

04:27.670 --> 04:28.990
Uh-huh!

04:29.420 --> 04:31.380
I'm glad you understand.

04:31.380 --> 04:34.290
Now, let's discuss how we can combat this curse.

04:34.290 --> 04:35.210
I know!

04:35.210 --> 04:36.250
Go ahead, Mia.

04:36.760 --> 04:39.250
How about buying a new scale?

04:40.580 --> 04:44.330
Mia, we're trying to have 
a serious conversation.

04:44.330 --> 04:45.970
Try not to joke too much.

04:45.970 --> 04:48.010
Huh? S-Sorry...

04:48.280 --> 04:50.020
Kagura!

04:50.020 --> 04:51.780
There, there.

04:50.830 --> 04:52.760
Now, back to how we can lose—

04:52.760 --> 04:55.520
I mean, how we can remove the curse.

04:57.960 --> 04:58.640
I know!

04:58.640 --> 04:59.650
Yes, Mia?

05:00.180 --> 05:02.310
How about limiting our carb intake?

05:02.030 --> 05:03.400
<b>Honor
Redeemed!!</b>

05:03.830 --> 05:06.910
I've heard just switching to a diet 
focused on meat and vegetables

05:07.240 --> 05:09.280
can make the weight melt away.

05:09.280 --> 05:10.540
Money...

05:10.540 --> 05:11.290
Huh?

05:11.910 --> 05:14.170
We don't have the money to buy meat.

05:14.170 --> 05:17.170
And these days, 
vegetables are expensive, too.

05:18.770 --> 05:20.400
I'm sorry.

05:20.400 --> 05:21.410
I know.

05:21.410 --> 05:22.420
Go ahead, Tsukuyo.

05:23.270 --> 05:24.550
How about exercise?

05:25.100 --> 05:27.800
That's what it comes down to, isn't it?

05:27.800 --> 05:30.630
I'd like to try Pilates.

05:31.980 --> 05:35.620
Very well. Though it's difficult 
to keep exercising alone,

05:35.620 --> 05:38.020
if we work together, 
we should be able to do it.

05:38.020 --> 05:40.730
We'll begin tomorrow morning.

05:41.140 --> 05:42.480
Yeah!

05:46.730 --> 05:48.990
This is pretty tough.

05:54.500 --> 05:58.750
That's what makes it an 
effective inner muscle workout.

05:59.750 --> 06:02.370
Penance by Pilates!

06:01.060 --> 06:03.750
<b>Penance by Pilates</b>

06:04.060 --> 06:07.010
So this is how adults exercise.

06:07.260 --> 06:09.300
Huh?

06:14.730 --> 06:17.290
Well, I need to chop firewood.

06:18.740 --> 06:21.110
I've gotta get ready for practice.

06:22.370 --> 06:24.060
I'll do the laundry.

06:24.060 --> 06:26.210
I'll help you.

06:30.080 --> 06:35.610
I've been thinking, aren't we 
pretty active all the time?

06:35.610 --> 06:36.790
Yeah, we are.

06:37.060 --> 06:38.140
Yeah.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.760
Aren't you going to work out with us, Kagura?

06:41.760 --> 06:45.970
Since I'm an adult, 
I'm able to maintain my figure.

06:45.970 --> 06:47.130
Like a true adult.

06:47.130 --> 06:48.290
That's not fair!

06:49.800 --> 06:53.300
Perhaps this is our only option after all.

06:57.090 --> 06:58.560
Dieting...

06:58.560 --> 07:00.090
No...

06:58.560 --> 07:04.060
<b>Dieting</b>

07:04.580 --> 07:06.010
Hang on a minute!

07:06.010 --> 07:07.820
But there's no other way.

07:07.820 --> 07:12.570
I know, but don't we need 
Akagami's help to do that?

07:12.850 --> 07:17.900
You're right. At our temple, 
you eat everything you're served.

07:14.580 --> 07:24.080
<b>Temple Rule</b>

07:15.830 --> 07:24.080
<b>Eat everything
you're served</b>

07:18.460 --> 07:24.310
As long as we have this rule, we need 
Akagami-kun to cook less than he usually does.

07:24.310 --> 07:31.930
B-B-But it'd be kind of embarrassing 
if Akagami found out we're dieting.

07:32.330 --> 07:33.970
You're so cute, Tsukuyo.

07:33.970 --> 07:34.420
Huh?

07:34.420 --> 07:36.020
You're such an innocent girl.

07:36.020 --> 07:36.720
Huh?

07:36.720 --> 07:39.130
You're such a flirt.

07:39.930 --> 07:41.000
Kurage?

07:41.000 --> 07:43.790
Why don't you just marry him?

07:45.140 --> 07:46.260
Marry him?!

07:46.900 --> 07:49.120
Kagura, what are you talking about?!

07:49.120 --> 07:50.770
I agree.

07:51.650 --> 07:53.160
What?!

07:53.160 --> 07:57.450
I think of Akagami-san as part of the family.

07:58.090 --> 08:01.210
I wish he could stay here forever.

08:01.210 --> 08:02.810
Kurage...

08:02.810 --> 08:07.940
If you married him, maybe he'd stay forever.

08:07.940 --> 08:10.710
You like Akagami that much?

08:11.210 --> 08:14.660
Akagami-san's cooking is just so delicious.

08:15.350 --> 08:18.410
He's got such a strong hold over my stomach,

08:18.410 --> 08:20.350
I'd be willing to give up my sister for it.

08:21.170 --> 08:23.100
What in the world are you saying?!

08:23.580 --> 08:26.090
Family and food are on the same level for you?!

08:26.090 --> 08:28.420
You're going to make me cry!

08:28.420 --> 08:30.500
Family members aren't food.

08:31.310 --> 08:33.610
Are all those nutrients 
not reaching your brain?!

08:33.610 --> 08:37.590
Anyway, since Yuzuki-oneechan is engaged...

08:38.130 --> 08:42.170
Will you marry Akagami-san, Tsukuyo-oneechan?

08:42.650 --> 08:45.120
Don't you think you're taking 
my marriage too lightly?!

08:45.340 --> 08:49.880
I-If you think that'll solve the problem, 
why don't <i>you </i>marry Akagami?

08:50.420 --> 08:52.090
Just kidding.

08:52.770 --> 08:53.620
I see.

08:54.130 --> 08:56.700
I'm off to seduce Akagami-san.

08:56.610 --> 08:58.640
<b>Let's make it so!!</b>

08:56.700 --> 08:58.640
No, wait!

09:00.140 --> 09:02.020
Now that I think about it,

09:02.410 --> 09:06.570
Akagami's cooking is mostly 
vegetarian and low-calorie.

09:06.570 --> 09:09.520
Maybe we're just growing.

09:09.810 --> 09:11.530
Yeah, we're just growing.

09:11.530 --> 09:13.570
Oh, we're all growing.

09:15.310 --> 09:16.530
I see.

09:16.850 --> 09:20.780
So I'm sure we weigh 
exactly as much as we should.

09:21.120 --> 09:24.540
Our weights will go back to normal soon.

09:25.590 --> 09:27.540
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

09:27.990 --> 09:31.040
Today, I tried making some Japanese sweets.

09:32.420 --> 09:34.050
Please have some.

09:35.250 --> 09:38.300
Damn you, Akagami!

09:38.300 --> 09:40.280
A-Akagami-kun...

09:40.280 --> 09:41.310
Marry me.

09:42.180 --> 09:43.430
My, my.

09:43.430 --> 09:48.730
<b>Out of Order</b>

09:45.370 --> 09:48.350
They're so good!

09:49.690 --> 09:55.010
The meals and snacks Akagami-san 
made today were delicious, too.

10:02.740 --> 10:06.310
I wish Akagami-san would stay forever.

10:07.460 --> 10:11.970
I wonder if he'll wait for me 
to become an adult.

10:15.230 --> 10:18.990
<b>You can't warm your buns over a votive candle.</b>

10:26.370 --> 10:27.570
Akagami-kun.

10:28.910 --> 10:31.480
What is it, Yuzuki-san?

10:31.800 --> 10:36.990
Um... Could you start adding 
pickled radishes to all our meals?

10:39.040 --> 10:40.310
Sure, I don't mind.

10:40.860 --> 10:43.980
Thanks a bunch, Akagami-kun.
I'll look forward to it.

10:45.450 --> 10:48.000
<i>But why pickled radishes?</i>

10:50.500 --> 10:53.300
<i>An axe?! Why is she carrying an axe?!</i>

10:56.730 --> 10:59.130
Is she planning to execute me?

10:59.820 --> 11:02.750
No, that's ridiculous. Yuzuki-san would never—

11:07.050 --> 11:09.770
That sound... There's no mistaking it.

11:09.770 --> 11:11.810
She's practicing her beheading skills.

11:11.810 --> 11:13.770
Is she going to split my skull open?

11:15.770 --> 11:18.320
Akagami-kun!

11:20.990 --> 11:24.280
I-I must do something to improve her mood!

11:31.650 --> 11:34.100
Wow, what an extravagant breakfast.

11:35.180 --> 11:37.550
It looks so tasty.

11:37.850 --> 11:38.900
Uh-huh.

11:41.540 --> 11:43.250
It's nothing special.

11:43.250 --> 11:46.520
<i>I included all of Yuzuki-san's favorites.</i>

11:46.520 --> 11:49.350
<i>This should fix her poor mood.</i>

11:56.710 --> 11:58.410
<i>No reaction?!</i>

11:56.860 --> 11:58.070
No Reaction

12:01.870 --> 12:03.320
What's wrong, Akagami?

12:04.570 --> 12:06.580
<i>No, it's not over yet.</i>

12:06.910 --> 12:11.580
<i>I know she'll love the top-quality 
pickled radishes she requested.</i>

12:11.830 --> 12:13.080
Crunch

12:12.330 --> 12:13.580
Crunch

12:13.080 --> 12:14.330
Munch

12:13.580 --> 12:14.830
Munch

12:14.330 --> 12:16.080
Chew

12:14.830 --> 12:16.080
Chew

12:19.610 --> 12:22.410
<i>My life is over...</i>

12:22.410 --> 12:25.590
Akagami! Akagami!

12:27.050 --> 12:30.350
When will she tell me the execution date?

12:30.650 --> 12:33.330
Will I have another chance before then?

12:35.290 --> 12:38.610
Yuzuki-san? What is it this time?

12:39.310 --> 12:40.450
Yuzuki-san—

12:47.170 --> 12:50.300
I can't take it anymore! My legs fell asleep!

12:50.300 --> 12:50.870
Huh?

12:51.770 --> 12:54.640
Akagami-kun, thank goodness you're here.

12:54.640 --> 12:56.370
Lend me your hand.

12:57.220 --> 13:00.090
Um, what about my execution?

13:00.830 --> 13:02.130
What are you talking about?

13:02.480 --> 13:03.900
Just give me your hand.

13:03.900 --> 13:06.460
What do you think you're stopping for?

13:07.260 --> 13:08.100
You must be punished.

13:10.090 --> 13:16.020
Take this.

13:11.170 --> 13:13.340
Kiki-san, no!

13:13.340 --> 13:16.020
Spare me!

13:17.130 --> 13:20.490
I can't! I can't take it anymore!

13:20.490 --> 13:23.450
<i>Th-This is kind of hot.</i>

13:26.130 --> 13:28.860
You were training just now?

13:29.850 --> 13:32.180
To be precise, she was practicing her training.

13:32.180 --> 13:33.740
She needs to get used to it first.

13:33.740 --> 13:34.780
I see.

13:34.780 --> 13:36.290
What she was just doing is called "teizu."

13:36.330 --> 13:37.290
<b>Teizu</b>

13:37.420 --> 13:39.630
<b>Please allow
me to enter</b>

13:37.560 --> 13:40.790
It's the first hurdle to 
training at the head temple,

13:39.540 --> 13:40.790
<b>No!</b>

13:41.200 --> 13:42.940
and you only managed two hours.

13:42.940 --> 13:45.060
You're actually required 
to do it for two whole days.

13:47.400 --> 13:49.680
And the axe she had this morning?

13:50.040 --> 13:52.100
She was practicing her firewood chopping.

13:52.100 --> 13:54.310
It's one of the daily chores you're 
expected to do while training.

13:55.310 --> 13:58.310
I thought she was going to 
use it to chop me apart.

13:58.980 --> 14:00.310
Why would you think that?!

14:00.660 --> 14:02.450
The same goes for breakfast this morning.

14:02.450 --> 14:04.360
Private conversations 
are prohibited during meals.

14:04.360 --> 14:07.240
You mustn't make a single sound,

14:07.240 --> 14:10.650
not even if you're eating pickled radishes.

14:10.650 --> 14:12.330
That was part of her training, too?

14:12.750 --> 14:15.450
In any case, she's too clumsy.

14:15.450 --> 14:19.360
She needs to practice as much as possible 
so she can become a head priest soon.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.240
You're right.

14:20.240 --> 14:21.330
You agree with her?

14:21.760 --> 14:23.700
Anyway, that's what she's up to.

14:23.700 --> 14:27.770
I'm sure it'll cause you all kinds of trouble, 
but I'd appreciate your help.

14:27.770 --> 14:28.840
Of course.

14:29.350 --> 14:32.350
<i>So she's training. 
Yuzuki-san never fails to impress.</i>

14:32.820 --> 14:35.400
<i>I'd like to begin pursuing 
my own enlightenment, but...</i>

14:35.400 --> 14:39.140
<i>No, right now I should spend all 
my energy supporting Yuzuki-san.</i>

14:39.140 --> 14:40.530
Oh, right.

14:42.020 --> 14:44.610
Do you want to train, too?

14:44.920 --> 14:45.440
Huh?

14:45.810 --> 14:46.360
What?

14:46.840 --> 14:47.920
Are you sure?

14:47.920 --> 14:51.160
You looked like you were about to force 
yourself on Yuzuki-san out of frustration

14:51.160 --> 14:53.820
unless I allowed you to train with her.

14:53.820 --> 14:57.000
Did I? I'm so sorry!

14:57.440 --> 15:01.120
Do I have the right to train, though?

15:01.120 --> 15:03.070
I'm still in debt.

15:03.070 --> 15:04.500
What are you talking about?

15:04.820 --> 15:09.010
I've seen all the efforts 
you've made at the temple.

15:09.010 --> 15:13.010
Hold your head high. 
You haven't been wasting your time here.

15:17.050 --> 15:20.270
It'd be encouraging to have a training partner.

15:22.900 --> 15:24.460
Then I gratefully accept your offer.

15:24.460 --> 15:25.460
Good.

15:25.460 --> 15:27.780
Yuzuki-san, I look forward 
to training with you.

15:28.550 --> 15:30.390
Let's do our best, Akagami-kun.

15:29.780 --> 15:31.580
Indeed.

15:34.230 --> 15:35.660
E-Excuse me!

15:35.660 --> 15:36.530
Mia-san?

15:36.530 --> 15:39.410
Will you allow me to train with you?

15:39.410 --> 15:40.790
Go, go.

15:41.270 --> 15:41.920
What?

15:42.240 --> 15:44.040
You're going to train with us, Mia-san?

15:44.040 --> 15:45.780
How truly encouraging!

15:45.780 --> 15:47.060
Really?

15:47.060 --> 15:48.800
Yes, we'd love to have you.

15:48.800 --> 15:50.050
That's great!

15:50.170 --> 15:53.090
Anyway, thank you for training me.

15:53.090 --> 15:54.460
Uh, sure.

15:55.300 --> 15:57.810
We have nothing to fear now!

16:00.550 --> 16:02.060
I'm home.

16:02.560 --> 16:06.310
You started training with Yuzu-nee?

16:06.310 --> 16:09.090
So you're Kiki-san's students now?

16:09.090 --> 16:10.060
Yes.

16:10.060 --> 16:11.190
I suppose we are.

16:11.190 --> 16:14.200
I see. Which means...

16:16.890 --> 16:19.700
You'll undergo tokudo. It won't be easy.

16:20.380 --> 16:21.580
Tokudo?

16:21.580 --> 16:22.580
What?

16:23.990 --> 16:25.050
Oh, right.

16:25.840 --> 16:27.940
I forgot to explain that part.

16:27.940 --> 16:29.090
Master...

16:29.490 --> 16:32.210
There are steps that must be taken 
to become a head priest.

16:32.210 --> 16:36.140
Before entering the training ground, 
you must first undergo "tokudo."

16:34.590 --> 16:38.850
<b>Tokudo</b>

16:36.140 --> 16:40.020
It involves studying sutras 
and rituals under a master

16:38.390 --> 16:40.100
<b>Reading Sutras and Other Texts</b>

16:39.640 --> 16:41.350
<b>How to Fold Work Clothes</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:42.100
and earning the right to become a priest.

16:40.890 --> 16:42.100
<b>Workflow</b>

16:42.820 --> 16:46.240
Put simply, it's becoming a priest.

16:46.240 --> 16:47.360
I see.

16:49.110 --> 16:52.910
Wait, what? I hadn't become a priest yet?

16:53.610 --> 16:56.610
No, you were just living at a temple.

16:57.050 --> 17:00.190
Just living at a temple?

17:02.540 --> 17:04.120
What's wrong, Akagami?!

17:04.900 --> 17:08.810
I was able to preserve my sanity 
while living with women

17:08.810 --> 17:12.260
because I thought I'd become a priest.

17:10.130 --> 17:15.590
<b>Harem!!</b>

17:10.130 --> 17:15.590
<b>Debauchery!!</b>

17:16.090 --> 17:21.000
Now that I know that was a lie, 
my worldly desires...

17:21.000 --> 17:22.850
Calm down, Akagami!

17:22.850 --> 17:25.390
That's right. Calm down.

17:25.390 --> 17:27.850
Could you stop doing that, please?

17:25.390 --> 17:27.850
<b>Squish</b>

17:27.850 --> 17:30.560
I'm teaching him to resist his worldly desires.

17:30.560 --> 17:32.980
I'll be the one to handle that!

17:35.580 --> 17:37.090
Oh, uh...

17:39.950 --> 17:44.080
W-Was my path to enlightenment an illusion?

17:44.080 --> 17:45.450
No, it wasn't.

17:47.090 --> 17:51.630
Trying to achieve enlightenment 
is the path to enlightenment itself.

17:52.090 --> 17:56.010
That's the second rule to achieving 
enlightenment, Akagami-kun.

17:56.010 --> 17:57.130
Yuzuki-san...

17:57.550 --> 18:00.640
Kiki-san, I completed six hours of teizu.

18:00.640 --> 18:02.640
Oh? Let's see.

18:03.590 --> 18:05.390
It was easier than I...

18:05.680 --> 18:13.150
Poke, poke.

18:06.310 --> 18:09.460
I'm ready to move on to 
the next stage of training.

18:12.070 --> 18:13.150
I can't...

18:14.870 --> 18:16.400
You've still got a long way to go.

18:16.730 --> 18:19.150
Come on, go chop some wood next.

18:21.100 --> 18:23.160
Thank you for your instruction!

18:23.730 --> 18:25.300
Yuzuki-san certainly is impressive.

18:26.210 --> 18:28.690
She's made so much more progress than me.

18:28.690 --> 18:30.170
Is that what you think?

18:34.440 --> 18:36.920
Yuzuki hasn't undergone tokudo yet, either.

18:37.350 --> 18:37.900
Huh?

18:37.900 --> 18:41.660
Like you, she hasn't even become a priest yet,

18:42.170 --> 18:44.930
though it sounds like she made 
herself out to be more than she is.

18:44.930 --> 18:51.690
If there's anything about her that 
seems different, it's her mindset.

18:52.930 --> 18:56.690
Normally, my students train for 
a year before undergoing tokudo,

18:57.160 --> 18:59.830
but she's attempting to do that in six months,

18:59.830 --> 19:02.200
while attending school, no less,

19:02.610 --> 19:06.200
so she can become a head priest 
as quickly as possible.

19:07.450 --> 19:11.610
And she's doing it to keep 
Mikazuki Temple open.

19:11.610 --> 19:14.470
I mustn't dawdle, either!

19:15.300 --> 19:16.390
Yuzuki-san!

19:22.860 --> 19:25.010
Let me join you!

19:26.160 --> 19:28.270
Sure. I've been waiting for you to ask.

19:29.650 --> 19:30.550
Yuzuki-san—

19:31.810 --> 19:34.270
But you said we'd fight together.

19:35.790 --> 19:38.370
What? I wasn't trying to cut you out.

19:38.370 --> 19:40.890
Of course you can join us. Right?

19:42.460 --> 19:46.370
Let's master chopping wood 
together and undergo tokudo.

19:46.660 --> 19:48.230
Yeah!

19:49.410 --> 19:52.100
Chopping wood has nothing 
to do with tokudo, though.

19:52.830 --> 19:54.130
Well, whatever.

19:54.500 --> 19:58.760
Kiki-san and Yuzuki-oneechan, we have a guest.

19:58.760 --> 19:59.880
Pardon the intrusion.

20:00.250 --> 20:00.970
Yikes.

20:00.970 --> 20:02.180
Hoan-san?

20:06.900 --> 20:08.140
Oh...

20:08.440 --> 20:10.700
That's Yuzu-nee's fiance?

20:10.700 --> 20:12.420
Why do you suppose he's here?

20:12.420 --> 20:13.900
I have no idea.

20:14.310 --> 20:17.260
What? Didn't he come to get down and dirty?

20:17.820 --> 20:18.720
Kurage?!

20:18.720 --> 20:21.930
They're engaged, right? 
They have an adult relationship.

20:21.930 --> 20:23.150
My, my.

20:23.150 --> 20:27.160
Yuzu-nee would never do anything 
like that. Right, Akagami?

20:27.160 --> 20:31.760
Is he using his engagement to 
Yuzuki-san to do things with her?!

20:31.760 --> 20:33.200
She would?!

20:33.200 --> 20:36.770
They're doing special training, 
mostly with their lower bodies.

20:36.770 --> 20:39.250
They're doing what? How very intriguing.

20:39.250 --> 20:43.600
I think I'll watch until they're done 
since I'm so worried about them.

20:43.600 --> 20:45.930
Why do you all seem to be enjoying this?!

20:46.350 --> 20:48.410
You're Yuzuki-san's family, aren't you?

20:50.610 --> 20:52.800
I apologize for suddenly dropping in.

20:52.800 --> 20:56.660
I just had to see the temple 
and family she was so proud of.

20:56.660 --> 20:59.120
Oh, uh... yes.

20:59.120 --> 21:01.730
I had some business to attend to, as well.

21:01.730 --> 21:03.070
Akagami-kun, was it?

21:03.070 --> 21:04.780
Do you have a moment?

21:07.490 --> 21:09.080
Well, well.

21:09.520 --> 21:11.900
This is even worse than I thought.

21:11.900 --> 21:13.080
I'm sorry.

21:14.060 --> 21:16.130
If you've got a problem with it, then leave.

21:16.130 --> 21:18.580
What? Kiki-san, you got changed, too?

21:18.580 --> 21:20.840
<i>Why was I invited to this meeting?</i>

21:21.430 --> 21:23.090
You haven't changed at all, Kiki.

21:24.340 --> 21:28.300
Aoba Yuzuki-san, I heard you 
haven't entered the priesthood yet.

21:28.860 --> 21:29.550
No.

21:29.550 --> 21:32.670
So what if she hasn't? You wanna go, huh?

21:33.140 --> 21:35.390
Kiki-san, what's gotten into you?!

21:36.300 --> 21:39.960
You'll be surprised to learn 
that I've become her master.

21:39.960 --> 21:44.340
I'll turn her into a priest in just six months.

21:44.340 --> 21:45.820
Uh, Kiki-san?!

21:46.830 --> 21:48.730
That will be too late.

21:49.690 --> 21:53.330
You will undergo tokudo within three months.

21:55.330 --> 21:56.730
What are you talking about?

21:57.340 --> 21:59.830
You know how strict our sect's tokudo is.

22:00.120 --> 22:05.560
If you can't, then I'd like to 
call off our engagement.

23:44.940 --> 23:59.950
<b>Next Time

What Color Are Your Panties?</b>

23:45.260 --> 23:47.770
Tsukuyo-oneechan, what's your favorite color?

23:47.770 --> 23:50.460
Pink, I guess. Light blue is good, too.

23:50.460 --> 23:52.960
I also like red. It's the color of passion.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.620
How bold of you.

23:54.620 --> 23:56.120
By the way, what are you wearing today?

23:56.120 --> 23:58.410
Hold on, what are we talking about?
